OL,3,ARussell Brand tells court allegations
OL,4,Ahad devastating impact on him
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrand, 51, is accused of three counts
OL,7,Fof rape, three counts of sexual
OL,8,Fassault, and one charge of attempted
OL,9,Findecent assault.
